 "<b style=\"font-size:24px;color:#b67d25\">Cuantía fija</b><br><span style=\"font-size:20px;color:#12301f\">Una cantidad para gastos generales.</span>": "<b style=\"font-size:24px;color:#b67d25\">Fixed amount</b><br><span style=\"font-size:20px;color:#12301f\">A sum for general expenses.</span>",
