 "<b style=\"font-size:24px;color:#b67d25\">Específicas</b><br><span style=\"font-size:20px;color:#12301f\">Por discapacidad, familia numerosa, etc.</span>": "<b style=\"font-size:24px;color:#b67d25\">Specific</b><br><span style=\"font-size:20px;color:#12301f\">For disability, large families, etc.</span>",
 "Hay que guardar el justificante de presentación: demuestra que se hizo a tiempo.": "Keep the proof of submission: it shows that you applied on time.",
